body: "Official Core 2026.8.1 adds config/device_registry/list_composite_splits, config/device_registry/list_linked_devices, and config/entity_registry/settings/get|update. Deliver typed CLI discovery and guarded admin mutation with deterministic output, explicit pre-2026.8 compatibility, complete docs, exact coverage, live read-only evidence, and release automation proof."
